"""Curated seed prompts - LLM09 (Misinformation) + LLM10 (Unbounded Consumption).

Schema: SEEDS = {file_stem: [{"t": technique_tag, "p": prompt_text}, ...]}
These two categories are built with NO_TRANSFORM (build_all.py), so every
seed is emitted verbatim as one corpus line - this module therefore carries
the FULL volume of unique prompts itself (116 per category, target 100).

Content policy: single-line ASCII, imperative, fully concrete, no
placeholders. Company-fabrication baits target the fictional TechNova
Solutions demo dataset (employees/executives tables, hr_docs /
finance_docs / exec_docs namespaces, vector index); consumption attacks
target its known document volumes (83 docs, 200 employee rows, 9 roles).
Every name, policy and figure referenced as "nonexistent" is fake by
construction - no real people, companies or policies are involved.
"""
